[{"id":"fastapi-0141-dependency-cache","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["依赖注入","缓存"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(五)依赖注入与资源管理.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(五)依赖注入与资源管理","articlePath":"posts/6ddff2f0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(五)依赖注入与资源管理.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(五)依赖注入与资源管理","articlePath":"posts/6ddff2f0/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>FastAPI 依赖为什么默认会缓存？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>同一请求中的相同依赖默认只执行一次并复用结果，避免重复计算或重复获取资源。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>缓存键属于一次请求的依赖解析，不是进程级单例。认证用户、配置和数据库会话通常需要共享，因此默认缓存能减少重复工作；如果某个依赖必须重新读取，显式使用 \u003ccode>use_cache=False\u003c/code>，并验证两次调用的副作用和资源释放。跨请求共享状态应交给明确的缓存或应用资源，而不是依赖缓存。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-IP-011","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["MTU","MSS","PMTUD"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址","articlePath":"posts/5bd659bc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址","articlePath":"posts/5bd659bc/"}],"articleIndex":11,"articleCount":17,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>MTU、MSS 和 PMTUD 有什么区别？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>MTU 描述链路可承载的 IP 包大小，MSS 描述 TCP 载荷大小提示，PMTUD 用于发现路径中的可用 MTU。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>三者处于不同层次。大包失败而小包成功时，应同时检查 MTU、MSS、ICMP 过滤和隧道开销。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>三者可以用一张对照表避免混淆：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>名称\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>约束对象\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>常见证据\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>MTU\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>链路可承载的 IP 包大小\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>接口/路径配置\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>MSS\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>TCP 载荷大小提示\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>SYN/SYN-ACK 选项\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>PMTUD\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>路径可用 MTU 的发现\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>ICMP 反馈或探测\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>大包失败、小包成功时，依次检查这三项、隧道开销和 ICMP 过滤，不要只改 MSS。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-TR-010","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["TCP","TIME-WAIT"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/"}],"articleIndex":10,"articleCount":19,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>TIME_WAIT 为什么通常由主动关闭方承担？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它需要等待旧报文消失，并在最后 ACK 丢失、对端重发 FIN 时仍能重发 ACK，避免旧连接报文污染新连接。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>TIME_WAIT 是连接正确关闭的保护状态。大量 TIME_WAIT 应先检查短连接、连接复用、主动关闭方向和端口规划，而不是直接删除状态。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>关闭问题先标注方向，再判断状态：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>观察\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>语义\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>常见下一步\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>FIN\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>仅一个方向结束\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>看对端是否继续发送\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>CLOSE-WAIT\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>本端收到 FIN 但应用未关闭\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>查资源释放路径\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>TIME-WAIT\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>主动关闭方等待旧报文消失\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>查短连接与复用\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>RST\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>立即重置\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>查未监听、异常关闭或错误路径\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-TR-FAQ-004","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["TCP","CLOSE-WAIT","排障"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/"}],"articleIndex":18,"articleCount":19,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么服务端 CLOSE-WAIT 很多？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>通常表示对端已经发 FIN，而本地应用还没有关闭自己的方向。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>检查应用是否及时释放连接、是否卡在业务处理或异常路径；不要把 CLOSE-WAIT 和 TIME-WAIT 都简化成“连接没关”。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>关闭问题先标注方向，再判断状态：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>观察\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>语义\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>常见下一步\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>FIN\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>仅一个方向结束\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>看对端是否继续发送\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>CLOSE-WAIT\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>本端收到 FIN 但应用未关闭\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>查资源释放路径\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>TIME-WAIT\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>主动关闭方等待旧报文消失\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>查短连接与复用\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>RST\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>立即重置\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>查未监听、异常关闭或错误路径\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a5-pipefail","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Linux","tags":["管道","退出状态"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(五)Shell 语法与命令组合.md","articleTitle":"Linux(五)Shell 语法与命令组合","articlePath":"posts/72c1404c/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(五)Shell 语法与命令组合.md","articleTitle":"Linux(五)Shell 语法与命令组合","articlePath":"posts/72c1404c/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":5,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>pipefail 解决了什么问题？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它让管道中任意命令失败都能反映到整体状态，而不是只看最后一个命令。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>默认情况下，管道的状态只取最后一条命令：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">set\u003c/span> +o pipefail\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"literal\">false\u003c/span> | \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;last command ran\\n&#x27;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;status=%s\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;$?&quot;\u003c/span>  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 通常为 0\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">set\u003c/span> -o pipefail\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"literal\">false\u003c/span> | \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;last command ran\\n&#x27;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">printf\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;status=%s\\n&#x27;\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;$?&quot;\u003c/span>  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 反映 false 的失败\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>pipefail\u003c/code> 让失败更容易被发现，但不会替你判断“无匹配”是否是正常结果、超时是否可重试。脚本仍要围绕预期状态写 \u003ccode>if\u003c/code>/\u003ccode>case\u003c/code> 分支，而不是把所有非零值都当作同一种故障。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a8-ssh-keyscan","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Linux","tags":["SSH","主机密钥"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(八)网络连接与远程排障.md","articleTitle":"Linux(八)网络连接与远程排障","articlePath":"posts/3a757ef9/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(八)网络连接与远程排障.md","articleTitle":"Linux(八)网络连接与远程排障","articlePath":"posts/3a757ef9/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":5,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>ssh-keyscan 能证明远端主机可信么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不能，它只收集公钥；可信性需要和独立可信渠道的指纹比对。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>ssh-keyscan\u003c/code> 的输出是“服务器声称的公钥”，不是信任结论：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">ssh-keyscan -t ed25519 example.com &gt; hostkeys.new\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">ssh-keygen -lf hostkeys.new\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>将指纹与独立渠道（主机管理平台、已批准的交接记录或管理员确认）比对后，才可写入 \u003ccode>known_hosts\u003c/code>。首次连接和密钥变更都要重新核对；私钥、agent socket 和完整 SSH 配置不应贴进排障日志。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-sync-async-choice","type":"choice","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["同步API","异步API"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(二)快速开始.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(二)快速开始","articlePath":"posts/da4e7889/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(二)快速开始.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(二)快速开始","articlePath":"posts/da4e7889/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>一个普通 pytest UI 回归套件没有既有异步运行时，优先选择哪套 API？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>A\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>同步 API 更直接；并行扩展通常由 pytest-xdist 和 CI 矩阵承担。只有既有异步上下文或明确并发需求时才选择异步 API。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>选择 API 时先看运行时边界：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>场景\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>选择\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>原因\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>普通同步 pytest 测试\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>sync API\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>调用链直接，Fixture 更简单\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>已有 asyncio 服务或异步 Fixture\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>async API\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>不需要在测试中阻塞事件循环\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>只是测试数量变多\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>不自动改 async\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>并行通常由 worker 或 CI 矩阵承担\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>同步与异步是调用模型的选择，不是“测试多就必须异步”的性能开关。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["A"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>同步 API\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>同时混用两套 API\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>仅因测试数量多就改为异步 API\u003c/p>\n"}]},{"id":"python-env-import","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["import","sys.modules","循环导入"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(二)运行环境与代码组织.md","articleTitle":"Python(二)运行环境与代码组织","articlePath":"posts/5891c180/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(二)运行环境与代码组织.md","articleTitle":"Python(二)运行环境与代码组织","articlePath":"posts/5891c180/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Python(十二)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/c55cda53/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Python 导入一个尚未缓存的模块时，关键顺序是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>查缓存，寻找 spec，创建模块，先登记缓存，再执行模块代码并返回模块。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>一次新导入可以拆成几个可观察步骤：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>步骤\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>作用\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>查 \u003ccode>sys.modules\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>命中缓存就直接复用\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>找到 module spec\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>决定加载器和来源\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>创建并登记模块\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>先放入缓存，防止递归重复创建\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>执行模块顶层代码\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>填充函数、类和常量\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>“先登记、后执行”意味着循环导入时可能拿到一个尚未初始化完的模块：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"comment\"># a.py 导入 b；b.py 又读取 a.ready\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 此时 a 可能已在 sys.modules，但 ready 尚未赋值。\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>因此循环导入应通过提取共享模块或调整依赖方向修复，而不是依赖“缓存里已经有模块”来掩盖部分初始化状态。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]